---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import AuthorHeader from '../components/AuthorHeader.astro';
import SiteFooter from '../components/SiteFooter.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About"
  description="About Reprator, a mobile architect based in Hyderabad."
>
  <AuthorHeader compact showBio={false}/>

  <section class="about">
    <p class="about__eyebrow">About</p>
    <h1 class="about__title">{site.name}</h1>
    <p class="about__lede">
      I build mobile software — and write about the parts that don’t fit in a
      changelog.
    </p>

    <div class="about__body">
      <p>
        I’m a mobile architect based in Hyderabad. For the past decade I’ve
        worked at the seam between product and engineering: shaping the
        architecture, staying close to the interface, and knowing when a simpler
        idea would be better.
      </p>
      <p>
        Before working for myself, I led design at a small product studio and
        spent a few years as a freelance developer. I’ve shipped tools for
        writers, researchers, and people who make things with their hands. The
        common thread is a preference for software that is quiet, legible, and
        built to last longer than the average launch cycle.
      </p>
      <p>
        This site is my notebook. It is a place for essays, observations, and
        the occasional field report. No growth hacks, no algorithmic feed, no
        reason for it to exist other than the pleasure of putting a thought
        somewhere it can be found again.
      </p>

      <h2>Now</h2>
      <p>
        I work on mobile architecture and take on a small number of projects
        each quarter. This site is where I collect notes from that work.
      </p>

      <h2>A few beliefs</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>The best interface is the one you stop noticing.</li>
        <li>Small teams with long horizons make the most coherent things.</li>
        <li>Software should let you leave without making you feel guilty.</li>
        <li>The web is better when more of it belongs to individuals.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Elsewhere</h2>
      <p>
        You can write to me at
        <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>. I read everything and
        reply when I can. For new posts, follow the
        <a href="/feed.xml">RSS feed</a>.
      </p>

      <h2>Colophon</h2>
      <p>
        This site is built with <a href="https://astro.build/">Astro</a> and
        plain CSS. Posts live as Astro components in the blog folder rather than
        Markdown files. There is no database, no tracking, and no unnecessary
        JavaScript.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <SiteFooter />
</BaseLayout>
